                      (    forth6809.asm):01765         ; own TXOFF path also writes ACIACR, and an interrupt landing
                      (    forth6809.asm):01766         ; mid-decision here could otherwise race it. If the ring has
                      (    forth6809.asm):01767         ; drained to INLOWATER or below and RTS is currently high,
